docs {
  # Delete Expense (`DeleteExpense`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.DeleteExpense` in [expense_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/expense_handler.go)
  **Route**: `DELETE /api/_private/v1/expenses/:expenseId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Permanently deletes an expense record:
  - Associated splits and payment links are deleted/cascaded.
  - Broadcasts `REFETCH_EXPENSES` event over WebSocket to all affected participants and friends.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `expenseId` (string, path parameter): ID of the expense to delete.
}
